=== tk note ===
Add a log entry

Usage: tk note [--if-rev <REV>] <REF> [MESSAGE]…

Arguments:
  <REF>       Ref, or part of a title
  [MESSAGE]…  What happened, in one line

Flags:
      --if-rev <REV>     Refuse if the entry changed since this revision was
                         read
  -h, --help             Print help

Global flags:
  -j, --json             Output as JSON
  -C, --dir <DIR>        Run in a different directory
      --tasks-dir <DIR>  Task store directory: exact path, must already exist
                         (no discovery)

