=== tk apply ===
Apply a batch of intents from stdin under one lock

Usage: tk apply [-f --file <PATH>] [--dry-run]

Flags:
  -f, --file <PATH>      Read the batch from a file instead of stdin
      --dry-run          Report what would change, and change nothing
  -h, --help             Print help

Global flags:
  -j, --json             Output as JSON
  -C, --dir <DIR>        Run in a different directory
      --tasks-dir <DIR>  Task store directory: exact path, must already exist
                         (no discovery)
